  (text "Design target: 1 A per port, 2 A aggregate shared load.\nCH217A: 51k ISET; 1.176 A typical limit.\n220uF output and 470 ohm discharge per port.\n\n5V_SYS supplies the hub/LDO and all port switches.\nEN# pull-ups hold ports OFF until hub power is valid.\nBC_EN disabled; individual power and overcurrent control.\nC106/C206/C306/C406 are DNP.\nData lines remain connected when port power is OFF." (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0985ad8-583d-45ba-a0c2-a42e4d837381"))
  (text "DIN USB DUT HUB / A8-R5\n95 x 80 mm PCB; USB2514B hub.\n1 A per port / 2 A shared DUT design target.\nPrototype." (at 185.42 355.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b27590a-405b-40d2-9a62-0b39f4bee3f1"))
